      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPIRALLING (2) failed to feature last start after settling off pace at this track, but prior to that won by a head at Sale (28.94) beating Jumbuk Sachin in a Grade 5 on August 23. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings four times from six attempts. Can bounce back. HI BIG BEN (1) missed the frame last time out when fifth at this track from Box four (30.79) but draws same box here as latest win. Should be about the mark. LITTLE MONKEY (8) produced a moderate performance last time when fifth at Sandown over 515m behind Mepunga Willow (30.27) in a Grade 5. Was a winner prior to that. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Better than last start and can bounce back. XARA NAVY (4) was out of the money at this circuit last start but can turn the form around.",
